  "body": "num_speculative_tokens changes the target verification batch size and therefore the concrete tensor shapes seen by torch.compile Inductor. Including it (and num_speculative_tokens_per_batch_size when dynamic speculative decoding is enabled) in SpeculativeConfig.compute_hash() prevents compiled-graph collisions across different values of k.\n\nFixes #53366",
